# React Performance

## Code splitting
- Every page lazy-loaded: `React.lazy` + `<Suspense fallback={<PageSkeleton />}>`.
- Heavy libs dynamic-imported at usage site.
- Preload next probable route on hover/focus.

## Renders
- No inline objects/arrays/functions as props to memoised children.
- Subscribe narrowly: `useAppSelector(s => s.game.phase)`.
- zustand: select slices. RTK Query: `selectFromResult` for narrow projection.
- Virtualise lists >100 items (`@tanstack/react-virtual`).
- Profile before adding `memo`/`useMemo` — measure.

## Real-time render budget (React-side)
- Apply frame batching from `frontend/performance.md`.
- `startTransition` for non-urgent updates.
- Wrap WS-driven setState in a tick aggregator hook.

## Hooks discipline
- One responsibility per hook. Name `useThing`.
- `useEffect` deps complete; never disable the lint rule.
- Cleanup every subscription (listeners, timers, sockets).
- `useSyncExternalStore` for external mutable sources outside Redux.
